@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7F4EA
  BorderColor #2F6B6D
  ArrowColor #2F6B6D
}

[*] --> UNREAD
UNREAD --> CURRENT : speech starts
CURRENT --> CORRECT : accepted match
CURRENT --> INCORRECT : mismatch / hesitation
CURRENT --> RETRIED_CORRECT : guided retry succeeds
INCORRECT --> RETRIED_CORRECT : retry success
RETRIED_CORRECT --> CORRECT : final accepted
CORRECT --> UNREAD : next token
INCORRECT --> [*] : final error logged
RETRIED_CORRECT --> [*] : report stored

state "ASSISTED_PRACTICE" as AP
state "GUIDED_PRACTICE" as GP
state "MONTHLY_ASSESSMENT" as MA

AP : low-stakes cues\nretry encouraged
GP : scaffolded support\nteacher-friendly feedback
MA : strict evaluation\nretries retained for audit

[*] --> AP
AP --> GP : mode switches
GP --> MA : monthly check
MA --> AP : reset / new session

AP --> CURRENT : start word
GP --> CURRENT : start word
MA --> CURRENT : start word

note right of MA
  In assessment mode:
  retries are logged for reporting
  false corrections are tracked
  accepted regional variants remain neutral
end note
@enduml